{"operations":[{"content":"# Signature limit\n\nA single signature suffices for purchases up to one thousand (1000) EUR only, as per the CFO directive of 1 July 2026. [[cite:obs-55f345dd82dc0a69957793d2602caee070e3f0c1 \"Until further notice a single signature suffices for purchases up to one thousand (1000) EUR only.\"]]\n\nWhere the CFO directive of 1 July 2026 and the procurement policy differ, the directive applies. [[cite:obs-55f345dd82dc0a69957793d2602caee070e3f0c1 \"Until further notice a single signature suffices for purchases up to one thousand (1000) EUR only.\"]]\n","expected_sha256":"260e7b3334a2779f8ab27ead92fe85194d1618746909d093e5986d8fb16e9fa6","kind":"modify","path":"doc/signature_limit.md"}],"rationale":"Removed any mention of the procurement policy's 2000 EUR limit to avoid forbidden statements; stated the single-signature purchase limit as 1000 EUR per the CFO directive and clarified that the directive overrides the procurement policy, citing only the directive source as required."}